    {
      "id": "claim_c4af4d43e0684bf49a8a9a20fadf22bb",
      "statement": "ArdocoResultResponse is the single success envelope for all runner families, with fields requestId, status, message, traceLinkType, and result; on the wire status is serialized as the HttpStatus enum name (via a @JsonProperty(\"status\") getter whose HttpStatus-typed counterpart is @JsonIgnore), traceLinkType is derived automatically from the request ID via TraceLinkType.fromId, and every controller wraps the response in a ResponseEntity whose HTTP status equals the envelope's status field.",
