    {
      "id": "claim_95aef719a2d147069a3081c1ee87cfe4",
      "statement": "ArDoCoApiResult stores traceLinks and inconsistencies as pre-serialized JSON strings annotated with @JsonRawValue, so Jackson embeds them verbatim into the response; its single-argument constructor defaults inconsistencies to the literal \"[]\", meaning only InconsistencyService populates a real inconsistencies array while the four TLR families always emit \"inconsistencies\": [].",
