    {
      "id": "claim_ab29a37acf8e42f2b4e269a4c6cf7dc1",
      "statement": "Each family's trace-link payload shape is fixed by its TraceLinkConverter method: SAD_CODE emits sentenceNumber/codeElementId/codeElementName plus modelElementId/modelElementName for TransitiveTraceLink whose first endpoint is an ArchitectureEntity, SAM_CODE emits modelElementId/modelElementName/codeElementId/codeElementName, SAD_SAM emits sentenceNumber/modelElementName/modelElementId; TransArCService reuses the sad-code converter and getSabCodeTraceLinks-equivalent getter, so SAD_SAM_CODE responses share the SAD_CODE shape and changing one converter silently changes both families.",
