    {
      "id": "claim_7ecdd5f4cc22486fb82dd3c56356250e",
      "statement": "The status/message pairing of the success envelope is fixed: POST start answers 200 with RESULT_IS_BEING_PROCESSED when a run is dispatched or in flight and 200 with RESULT_IS_READY when already cached; start-and-wait answers 200 + RESULT_IS_READY or 202 + REQUEST_TIMED_OUT_START_AND_WAIT; GET get-result answers 200 + RESULT_IS_READY or 202 + RESULT_NOT_READY; wait-for-result answers 200 + RESULT_IS_READY or 202 + REQUEST_TIMED_OUT; the result field is non-null exactly when the result is ready, and the wait budget comes from the tlr.timeout.seconds property (60s).",
      "evidence": [
