    {
      "id": "claim_8f32996c90a54879a8af55ec78ad114e",
      "statement": "ErrorResponse is the failure schema with three fields: timestamp (a ZonedDateTime stamped from the system clock in the no-arg constructor and serialized with @JsonFormat pattern dd-MM-yyyy HH:mm:ss z), status (HttpStatus serialized as the enum name), and message (defaulting to \"Unexpected error\" when only a status is given); unlike the success envelope it does not echo the request ID as a field.",
