    {
      "id": "claim_e501b23d2f8040548030cce0e12da761",
      "statement": "The response model is pinned by tests: testUtil.TestUtils asserts the exact HTTP status, envelope status, message constant, traceLinkType, and result presence for every flow in the matrix (fresh start, cached start, not-ready get, timed-out and ready waits, invalid IDs, empty files); AbstractTLRControllerTest exercises the unknown-ID and empty-file paths end to end against a live Redis container asserting UNPROCESSABLE_CONTENT; and TraceLinkConverterTest pins that an empty trace-link list serializes to \"[]\", the minimum shape the @JsonRawValue contract relies on.",
